exact Hfirst_tag_inc.
exact Hsecond_tag_inc_stay.
cases Hsecond_inc_inc Hsecond_tag_inc_inc Hsecond_rel_inc_inc.
specialize finite_common_value y1 y2 succ(x) as Hsame.
apply Hsame.
exact Hfirst_rel_inc.
exact Hsecond_rel_inc_inc.
